# The Windows installer is fetched over HTTP and executed byte-for-byte, from
# raw.githubusercontent.com and from the site's /downloads. Git must not touch
# these files: an end-of-line rewrite reflows a batch file whose control flow is
# built out of goto labels, and any re-encoding risks the UTF-8 BOM that Windows
# PowerShell 5.1 needs in order not to read the script as Windows-1252.
*.bat -text
*.ps1 -text
*.vbs -text
